WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
What we're seeing with the increased national attention

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:06.280
is bringing in nationally recognized influencers.

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.240
They're going where they can get the views

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.640
and create the perception.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.880
That's Chief Bob Day.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.320
The chief thinks the guy with the selfie stick

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.400
at the riots is the problem,

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.360
not the loon strapped with a machete.

